  "description": "One room, one projector, one lapel pack, one AV desk, one lectern, one foyer. Three 30-minute talks with questions after each. The projector is claimed by every talk and every deck load, so each load sits in a gap; the lapel pack is what makes the changeovers real steps. Question blocks are the only elastic (chair trims talk 3's questions if the first two run long). Catering runs in parallel from 90 minutes in and the third changeover waits on the foyer being cleared; the last item, the AV strike, lands on the 10:30 coffee break.",
